Can you explain how `OrderController.java` coordinates with `PaymentCallbackHandler.java` when receiving asynchronous payment notifications from the payments gateway?

```java
@PostMapping("/v1/payments/callback")
public ResponseEntity<Void> handlePaymentCallback(
        @RequestHeader("X-Cymbal-Signature") String signature,
        @RequestBody PaymentCallbackPayload payload) {
    if (!signatureVerifier.isValid(signature, payload)) {
        return ResponseEntity.status(HttpStatus.UNAUTHORIZED).build();
